TI  - nBERT: Harnessing NLP for Emotion Recognition in Psychotherapy to Transform Mental Health Care
T2  - INFORMATION
LA  - English
KW  - emotion recognition
KW  - NLP in life sciences
KW  - psychotherapy transcripts
KW  - mental health diagnostics
