TI  - Can chatbots help to motivate smoking cessation? A study on the effectiveness of motivational interviewing on engagement and therapeutic alliance
T2  - BMC PUBLIC HEALTH
LA  - English
KW  - Chatbot
KW  - Smoking Cessation
KW  - Motivational Interviewing
KW  - Engagement
