TI  - AI Chatbots for Mental Health Self-Management: Lived Experience-Centered Qualitative Study
T2  - JMIR MENTAL HEALTH
LA  - English
KW  - artificial intelligence
KW  - AI
KW  - large language model
KW  - LLM
KW  - mental health
KW  - depression
KW  - chatbot
KW  - harms
