TI  - Lilobot: A Cognitive Conversational Agent to Train Counsellors at Children's Helplines
T2  - JOURNAL OF MEDICAL SYSTEMS
LA  - English
KW  - Conversational agent
KW  - Chatbot
KW  - Training
KW  - Child counselling
