TI  - Using Large Language Models for Chronic Disease Management Tasks: Scoping Review
T2  - JMIR MEDICAL INFORMATICS
LA  - English
KW  - chronic diseases
KW  - disease management
KW  - artificial intelligence in health care
KW  - large language models
KW  - natural language processing
