TI  - DeliLaw: A Chinese Legal Counselling System Based on a Large Language Model
T2  - PROCEEDINGS OF THE 33RD ACM INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON INFORMATION AND KNOWLEDGE MANAGEMENT, CIKM 2024
