TI  - A Comparative Study of Responses to Retina Questions from Either Experts, Expert-Edited Large Language Models, or Expert-Edited Large Language Models Alone
T2  - OPHTHALMOLOGY SCIENCE
LA  - English
KW  - Artificial fi cial intelligence
KW  - Chatbot
KW  - ChatGPT
KW  - Large language model
