TI  - Empathizing Before Generation: A Double-Layered Framework for Emotional Support LLM
T2  - PATTERN RECOGNITION AND COMPUTER VISION, PRCV 2024, PT II
LA  - English
CP  - 7th Chinese Conference on Pattern Recognition and Computer Vision
KW  - Large language model
