TI  - Fine-Tuning Large Language Models for Motivational Interviewing in Health Behavior Change: Development and Evaluation Study
T2  - JMIR FORMATIVE RESEARCH
LA  - English
KW  - motivational interviewing
KW  - large language models
KW  - health education
KW  - behavior change
