TI  - Advancing Tinnitus Therapeutics: GPT-2 Driven Clustering Analysis of Cognitive Behavioral Therapy Sessions and Google T5-Based Predictive Modeling for THI Score Assessment
T2  - IEEE ACCESS
LA  - English
KW  - Augmentation
KW  - cognitive
KW  - CBT
KW  - GPT-2
KW  - Google
KW  - tinnitus
