TI  - Behavior Change Content and Implementation of Large Language Model-Driven Conversational Agents in Cardiometabolic Care: Scoping Review
T2  - JOURNAL OF MEDICAL INTERNET RESEARCH
LA  - English
KW  - large language models
KW  - conversational agents
KW  - chatbots
KW  - cardiometabolic diseases
