TI  - Empathetic Large Language Models, the social capacities and human flourishing
T2  - INQUIRY-AN INTERDISCIPLINARY JOURNAL OF PHILOSOPHY
LA  - English
KW  - Chatbots
KW  - artificial intelligence
KW  - perfectionism
KW  - friendship
