AB  - As AI-powered chatbots become more common in mental health care, we explore in this commentary the ethical concerns they raise for LGBTQ2+ individuals - users who already face considerable systemic barriers and stigma. We examine how these tools, while promising greater access, may unintentionally perpetuate harm through bias, privacy risks, and techno-solutionism.
