TI  - Viva Understanding or Narrowly Okay? The Impact of Empathy on User Forgiveness and Perceived Bottlenecks in LLMs
T2  - PACIFIC ASIA CONFERENCE ON INFORMATION SYSTEMS - PACIS 2024
LA  - English
