TI  - Evaluation of chatbot-delivered interventions for self-management of depression: Content analysis
T2  - JOURNAL OF AFFECTIVE DISORDERS
LA  - English
KW  - Conversational agent
KW  - Chatbot
KW  - Digital health
KW  - mHealth
KW  - Depression
KW  - Mood disorders
