TI  - Artificial intelligence: reflecting on the past and looking towards the next paradigm shift
T2  - JOURNAL OF EXPERIMENTAL & THEORETICAL ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE
LA  - English
KW  - Artificial intelligence
KW  - machine learning
KW  - deep learning
KW  - natural language processing
