TI  - New Doc on the Block: Scoping Review of AI Systems Delivering Motivational Interviewing for Health Behavior Change
T2  - JOURNAL OF MEDICAL INTERNET RESEARCH
LA  - English
KW  - artificial intelligence
KW  - AI
KW  - motivational interviewing
KW  - large language models
