TI  - PsyChat: A Client-Centric Dialogue System for Mental Health Support
T2  - PROCEEDINGS OF THE 2024 27 TH INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON COMPUTER SUPPORTED COOPERATIVE WORK IN DESIGN, CSCWD 2024
