TI  - Optimization of University Counseling Consent Forms With Large Language Models: Multidimensional Comparative Evaluation
T2  - JOURNAL OF MEDICAL INTERNET RESEARCH
LA  - English
KW  - large language models
KW  - informed consent forms
KW  - university counseling
KW  - mental health accessibility
KW  - higher education
