TI  - What Do People See in Large Language Models' Social Behavior? Exploring individuals' Reactions to LLM-LLM Interactions and Their Impact on Technology Perceptions
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF HUMAN-COMPUTER INTERACTION
LA  - English
