TI  - Evaluation of an Artificial Intelligence Conversational Chatbot to Enhance HIV Preexposure Prophylaxis Uptake: Development and Usability Internal Testing
T2  - JOURNAL OF MEDICAL INTERNET RESEARCH
LA  - English
KW  - artificial intelligence
