TI  - PaRT: Enhancing Proactive Social Chatbots with Personalized Real-Time Retrieval
T2  - PROCEEDINGS OF THE 48TH INTERNATIONAL ACM SIGIR CONFERENCE ON RESEARCH AND DEVELOPMENT IN INFORMATION RETRIEVAL, SIGIR 2025
