TI  - Inaccurate Empathy is Worse than Minimal Empathy in Affective Human-Robot Interaction
T2  - 2024 12TH INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON AFFECTIVE COMPUTING AND INTELLIGENT INTERACTION WORKSHOPS AND DEMOS, ACIIW
