TI  - Hi, I'm Cecil(y) the Smoking Cessation Chatbot: The Effectiveness of Motivational Interviewing and Confrontational Counseling Chatbots and the Moderating Role of the Need for Autonomy and Self-efficacy
T2  - CHATBOT RESEARCH AND DESIGN, CONVERSATIONS 2022
