TI  - EduMate: LLM-Powered Detection of Student Learning Emotions and Efficacy in Semi-structured Counseling
T2  - NATURAL LANGUAGE PROCESSING AND CHINESE COMPUTING, NLPCC 2025, PT I
LA  - English
CP  - 14th International Conference on Natural Language Processing and Chinese Computing-NLPCC-Annual
