TI  - Examining Spanish Counseling with MIDAS: a Motivational Interviewing Dataset in Spanish
T2  - PROCEEDINGS OF THE 2025 CONFERENCE OF THE NATIONS OF THE AMERICAS CHAPTER OF THE ASSOCIATION FOR COMPUTATIONAL LINGUISTICS: HUMAN LANGUAGE TECHNOLOGIES, VOL 2: SHORT PAPERS
