TI  - Empathetic Conversational Agents: Utilizing Neural and Physiological Signals for Enhanced Empathetic Interactions
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF HUMAN-COMPUTER INTERACTION
LA  - English
KW  - Conversational agent
KW  - neurophysiological emotion recognition
KW  - empathy
