TI  - Longitudinal behavioral change coaching with multi LLM agents: Multi-scale summaries and automated dialogue steering
T2  - SMART HEALTH
LA  - English
KW  - Behavioral change coaching
KW  - Large Language Model
KW  - Conversational agent
KW  - Long-term tracking
KW  - Motivational interviewing
