TI  - Counseling Chatbot Design: The Effect of Anthropomorphic Chatbot Characteristics on User Self-Disclosure and Companionship
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF HUMAN-COMPUTER INTERACTION
LA  - English
KW  - SOCIAL RESPONSES
KW  - MANIFEST PERSONALITY
