TI  - A scoping review of empathy recognition in text using natural language processing
T2  - JOURNAL OF THE AMERICAN MEDICAL INFORMATICS ASSOCIATION
LA  - English
KW  - empathy
KW  - communication
KW  - natural language processing
KW  - machine learning
