TI  - Combining Psychological Theory with Language Models for Suicide Risk Detection
T2  - 17TH CONFERENCE OF THE EUROPEAN CHAPTER OF THE ASSOCIATION FOR COMPUTATIONAL LINGUISTICS, EACL 2023
LA  - English
CP  - 17th Conference of the European-Chapter of the Association-for-Computational-Linguistics (EACL)
