TI  - Association between working alliance and treatment outcomes in a mobile health intervention with a conversational agent (CanRelax)
T2  - INTERNET INTERVENTIONS-THE APPLICATION OF INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY IN MENTAL AND BEHAVIOURAL HEALTH
LA  - English
KW  - Digital health
KW  - Working alliance
KW  - Therapeutic alliance
