TI  - Which voice aids mental health interactions? Exploring dual-pathway effects of voice anthropomorphism of AI health chatbots on patient anxiety
T2  - INDUSTRIAL MANAGEMENT & DATA SYSTEMS
LA  - English
KW  - AI health chatbots
KW  - Voice anthropomorphism
KW  - Patient anxiety
