TI  - Do Anthropomorphic Chatbots Increase Counseling Satisfaction and Reuse Intention? The Moderated Mediation of Social Rapport and Social Anxiety
T2  - CYBERPSYCHOLOGY BEHAVIOR AND SOCIAL NETWORKING
LA  - English
KW  - chatbot
KW  - anthropomorphism
KW  - rapport
