TI  - Artificial intelligence mediated emotional support in mental health and its ethical and governance implications in digital public health
T2  - DISCOVER PUBLIC HEALTH
LA  - English
KW  - Conversational agents
KW  - Digital mental health
KW  - Help-seeking behavior
KW  - Algorithmic bias
KW  - Mental health governance
