TI  - Fine-tuning LLM for Counseling Application in Federated Learning Setting
T2  - COMPANION OF THE 2025 ACM INTERNATIONAL JOINT CONFERENCE ON PERVASIVE AND UBIQUITOUS COMPUTING, UBICOMP COMPANION 2025
LA  - English
CP  - 2025 International Joint Conference on Pervasive and Ubiquitous Computing-UbiComp Companion
