TI  - Training Empathetic Communication Skills in Medical Students With a Role-Prompted GPT-4o Chatbot: Quasi-Experimental Intervention Study
T2  - JMIR MEDICAL EDUCATION
LA  - English
KW  - artificial intelligence
KW  - AI
KW  - generative pretrained transformer
KW  - ChatGPT
KW  - chatbot
