TI  - Does the Digital Therapeutic Alliance Exist? Integrative Review
T2  - JMIR MENTAL HEALTH
LA  - English
KW  - psychotherapy
KW  - mental health
KW  - psychiatry
KW  - artificial intelligence
KW  - therapeutic alliance
KW  - digital interventions
