TI  - Addressing Patient Questions on Spinal Muscular Atrophy: Performance of Large Language Models in a Genetic Context
T2  - GAZI MEDICAL JOURNAL
LA  - English
KW  - Spinal muscular atrophy
KW  - genetic counseling
KW  - artificial intelligence
KW  - health information quality
KW  - large language models
