TI  - Development and Evaluation of ClientBot: Patient-Like Conversational Agent to Train Basic Counseling Skills
T2  - JOURNAL OF MEDICAL INTERNET RESEARCH
LA  - English
KW  - psychotherapy training
KW  - interactive learning
KW  - conversational agents
