TI  - How Can Client Motivational Language Inform Psychotherapy Agents?
T2  - PROCEEDINGS OF THE 9TH WORKSHOP ON COMPUTATIONAL LINGUISTICS AND CLINICAL PSYCHOLOGY, CLPSYCH 2024
