TI  - Mitigating Boredom Using An Empathetic Conversational Agent
T2  - PROCEEDINGS OF THE 20TH ACM INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON INTELLIGENT VIRTUAL AGENTS (ACM IVA 2020)
LA  - English
CP  - 20th ACM International Conference on Intelligent Virtual Agents (ACM IVA)
KW  - Conversational Agent
KW  - Empathetic Agent
