TI  - Artificial intelligence chatbots in response to patient's common inquiries about chordoma: A cross-sectional study
T2  - BRAIN AND SPINE
LA  - English
KW  - Chordoma
KW  - Artificial intelligence
KW  - Large language model
KW  - AI assistance
KW  - Physician-patient communication
