T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF HUMAN-COMPUTER INTERACTION
LA  - English
KW  - Sleep
KW  - self-conscious emotions
KW  - behavioral change
KW  - chatbot
KW  - empathetic dialogue
KW  - IMPROVE SLEEP
