TI  - The Dark-Affective Bench: A Benchmark for Evaluating Maladaptive Personality Traits and Affective Tendencies in Large Language Models
T2  - 2025 IEEE INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON BIG DATA, BIGDATA
LA  - English
CP  - 2025 IEEE International Conference on Big Data-BigData
KW  - Large language models
KW  - Benchmark
